martphone-breathalyser.webp","image_ratio":"1","promo_title":"Pocket-sized breathalyser with fast & accurate BAC testing","content":"<p>Know when you are sober enough to drive with just a BAC test using an AlcoSense personal breathalyser.<\/p>","link_url":"shopify:\/\/collections\/personal-breathalysers","button_label":"","color_scheme":"1","button_style":"btn btn--primary"}},"collection-products":{"type":"main-collection-products","blocks":{"wide_promotion_Rwb3Ub":{"type":"wide-promotion","settings":{"position":"top","view":"grid_list","hide_on_filter":false,"min_height":150,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Quick_breathalyser_screening_for_your_employees.jpg","link_url":"","content":"<p><strong>Alcohol testing for law enforcement & security<\/strong><\/p>","text_type_scale":"--h3-font-size","text_width":800,"text_alignment":"justify-start items-center","button_label":"","button_style":"btn btn--primary","text_color":"#ffffff","tint_color":"#000000","tint_opacity":40}},"image_promotion_9URbba":{"type":"image-promotion","disabled":true,"settings":{"position":1,"view":"grid_list","hide_on_filter":true,"min_height":150,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/zenith_in_the_car_2.png","link_url":"shopify:\/\/blogs\/resources\/the-best-personal-breathalysers","content":"<p>Best breathalysers for P-Platers<\/p>","text_type_scale":"1em","text_width":400,"text_alignment":"justify-center items-end text-center","button_label":"Shop Recommendations","button_style":"link","text_color":"#ffffff","tint_color":"#000000","tint_opacity":20}},"card_promotion_xPqwLN":{"type":"card-promotion","disabled":true,"settings":{"position":9,"view":"grid_list","hide_on_filter":true,"color_scheme":"1","image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Man_blowing_into_alcohol_interlock.jpg","image_ratio":"0.75","link_url":"shopify:\/\/blogs\/resources\/the-best-personal-breathalysers","title":"How to choose a breathalyser?","content":"<p>Read our guide on how to choose the best breathalyser for yourself or for others! <\/p>","button_label":"Read more","button_style":"btn btn--secondary","button_bottom_align":true}},"wide_promotion_C9Dkt9":{"type":"wide-promotion","disabled":true,"settings":{"position":"bottom","view":"grid_list","hide_on_filter":false,"min_height":250,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Safety_officers.webp","link_url":"shopify:\/\/pages\/talk-to-sales","content":"<h3>Buy breathalysers that suit your breath alcohol testing needs.<\/h3><p>Accurate & reliable alcohol testing equipment to conduct on-site testing for various industries. Contact us for help with your company's breathalyser sales and service needs.<\/p><p><\/p>","text_type_scale":"--h6-font-size","text_width":800,"text_alignment":"justify-center items-center text-center","button_label":"Get corporate pricing","button_style":"btn btn--secondary","text_color":"#ffffff","tint_color":"#000000","tint_opacity":20}}},"block_order":["wide_promotion_Rwb3Ub","image_promotion_9URbba","card_promotion_xPqwLN","wide_promotion_C9Dkt9"],"custom_css":["h3 {font-size: 25px;}"],"settings":{"products_per_page":50,"card_size_mobile":"small","card_size":"medium","show_layout_toggle":true,"enable_filtering":true,"filters_open_lg":true,"stick_on_scroll":true,"show_filter_counts":true,"expand_filters":true,"max_filter_options":10,"enable_sorting":true,"sort_first":true}},"faq_LkjQiT":{"type":"faq","blocks":{"question_VhCDdp":{"type":"question","settings":{"icon":"none","heading":"What breathalyser technology does Andatech use?","text":"<p>Andatech uses industrial grade advanced platinum fuel cell technology to power our<br\/>breathalysers, leading to fast and accurate BAC results at all times.<\/p>"}},"question_hxBUp7":{"type":"question","settings":{"icon":"none","heading":"Is a breathalyser accurate?","text":"<p>Breathalysers are the easiest and most accurate way to estimate a person’s intoxication level by measuring the concentration of alcohol found in an individual’s breath sample.<\/p>"}},"question_D7DH6N":{"type":"question","settings":{"icon":"none","heading":"How does a breathalyser work?","text":"<p>Breathalysers work by analysing a breath sample blown into the device and calculating the concentration of alcohol that is found within the breath sample or <a href=\"https:\/\/andatech.com.au\/blogs\/resources\/what-is-brac?\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"What is breath alcohol concentration\">breath alcohol concentration (BrAC)<\/a>.<\/p><p>Breathalysers do this either by using semiconductor or fuel cell technology.<\/p>"}},"question_trxfGF":{"type":"question","settings":{"icon":"none","heading":"What are breathalyser best practices?","text":"<ul><li>Ensure test subject has not consumed food or drink for 15 to 20 minutes before the test<\/li><li>Use a new mouthpiece for every new test subject<\/li><li>Always store the breathalyser according to Andatech storage instructions and guidelines<\/li><li>Send your breathalyser for calibration every 6 months to ensure optimal results and<br\/>accuracy at all times.<\/li><\/ul>"}},"question_Ag4mtp":{"type":"question","settings":{"icon":"none","heading":"Is there a way to save breath alcohol data of team members?","text":"<p>Most Andatech portable workplace breathalysers have an<br\/>internal memory capacity of at least 100 tests (can be increased with an SD card).<\/p><p>Selected Andatech breathalysers are compatible with the <a href=\"https:\/\/andatech.com.au\/pages\/andalink\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Andalink data management system\">Andalink<\/a> data management system to save tests and view them in an easy-to-read chart.<\/p>"}},"question_YfWiTH":{"type":"question","settings":{"icon":"none","heading":"Do breathalysers also detect drugs?","text":"<p>Andatech breathalysers do not detect drugs and can only detect specific alcohol concentration in one’s breath.<\/p><p><a href=\"https:\/\/andatech.com.au\/pages\/drug-test-kits\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Andatech drug test kits\">Drug test kits<\/a> from Andatech, however, are able to detect drugs and alcohol with cut-off levels complying with Australian Standard guidelines.<\/p>"}},"question_c4qVGb":{"type":"question","settings":{"icon":"none","heading":"Are wall-mounted breathalysers better than personal breathalysers?","text":"<p>Wall-mounted breathalysers have features that are unique to them and the same can be said about <a href=\"https:\/\/andatech.com.au\/collections\/portable-breathalysers\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Andatech portable breathalysers\">portable breathalysers<\/a>.<\/p><p>Wall-mounted breathalysers from Andatech have advanced features including door access<br\/>control, temperature screening and a link to the <a href=\"https:\/\/andatech.com.au\/pages\/andalink\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Andalink data management system\">Andalink<\/a> data management system.<\/p>"}}},"block_order":["question_VhCDdp","question_hxBUp7","question_D7DH6N","question_trxfGF","question_Ag4mtp","question_YfWiTH","question_c4qVGb"],"settings":{"heading":"Breathalyser FAQs","heading_align":"text-center","color_scheme":"1","full_width":false}}},"order":["collection-banner","featured_product_w8NnWH","icons_with_text_fdyNpj","featured_collection_rUPWc7","featured_collection_awnrYd","featured_collection_9ATAEJ","featured_collection_nPyEcK","collection-products","faq_LkjQiT"]}